meta {
  name: Identity Protection - risky users read
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/identityProtection/riskyUsers?$select=id,riskLevel,riskState
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  The risk half of the launch transport (posture-connector.ts listRiskyUsers): id, riskLevel and riskState only. Identity Protection lists only the users it has flagged, so a user absent from this list has no detected risk - but only if this read succeeded. A tenant without IdentityRiskyUser.Read.All (application) answers 403, and the connector must read that as unknown risk, never none.
}
